  "decision_rule": "Publish every selected row and omission; no claim of diagnostic completeness from token savings alone. A missing actionable span means the compact result is insufficient for that annotated detail and requires log lookup; a generic pass/fail use remains separate. Do not tune reducer against this cohort and call it held-out.",
